    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u200a<i>The planets have aligned: you and the mask have found each other.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/42b27d1a8ac464808d07b648c4df379d.avif?t=1732546349\" width=618 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mask Around</strong> is a 2D shooter platformer roguelite where every drop of <i>juice</i> counts. This prized yellow goo will boost your moveset in... unexpected ways. Fly, jump, and punch with the gigantic hand coming out your backpack, or decide to take some risk and invest your precious juice in items and weapons. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Punch, kick and shoot increasingly creepy enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trade juice for weapons and other powerful artefacts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stumble upon Astralis classified secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/34e594a7d3f01b1a29bb2ca3ab49c21e.avif?t=1732546349\" width=618 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the disorienting floors of your former employer facility, the <i>Astralis Foundation</i>, you'll stumble upon many useful trinkets... </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Masks</strong> with unique powers, that you keep across runs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Items</strong> like the Moon Boots that lets you skywalk, or the Magic Trigger that will make corpses explode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Weapons</strong>, including your classic sniper &amp; shotgun, but also some more exotic picks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fresh drinks</strong> that will temporarily boost your stats </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Backpack</strong> skins, for fashion needs  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/9e5ff5440cb634aca7308e5a818a3022.poster.avif?t=1732546349\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/9e5ff5440cb634aca7308e5a818a3022.apng?t=1732546349\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=116 /></picture></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200aSee you <strong><i>around</i></strong>!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u200a<i>The planets have aligned: you and the mask have found each other.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/42b27d1a8ac464808d07b648c4df379d.avif?t=1732546349\" width=618 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mask Around</strong> is a 2D shooter platformer roguelite where every drop of <i>juice</i> counts. This prized yellow goo will boost your moveset in... unexpected ways. Fly, jump, and punch with the gigantic hand coming out your backpack, or decide to take some risk and invest your precious juice in items and weapons. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Punch, kick and shoot increasingly creepy enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trade juice for weapons and other powerful artefacts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stumble upon Astralis classified secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/34e594a7d3f01b1a29bb2ca3ab49c21e.avif?t=1732546349\" width=618 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the disorienting floors of your former employer facility, the <i>Astralis Foundation</i>, you'll stumble upon many useful trinkets... </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Masks</strong> with unique powers, that you keep across runs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Items</strong> like the Moon Boots that lets you skywalk, or the Magic Trigger that will make corpses explode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Weapons</strong>, including your classic sniper &amp; shotgun, but also some more exotic picks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fresh drinks</strong> that will temporarily boost your stats </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Backpack</strong> skins, for fashion needs  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/9e5ff5440cb634aca7308e5a818a3022.poster.avif?t=1732546349\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849230/extras/9e5ff5440cb634aca7308e5a818a3022.apng?t=1732546349\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=116 /></picture></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200a\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u200aSee you <strong><i>around</i></strong>!</p></li></ul>",
